{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Cell \u2014 CORRIDOR 1-D credit-assignment probe (cog-only)",
    "description": "Reductionist diagnostic: ONE food straight ahead (\u2212Z) at corridor_distance, bug heading-LOCKED (forward/reverse only), each eat resets to start = a fresh trial. Minimal cog-only graph: scent \u2192 ScentCompass \u2192 state EPM \u2192 ActionDecoder (coxswain, thrust-only 3 bins {reverse,pause,forward}) \u2192 MotorBus (1 channel) \u2192 body. NO HK swim, NO whisker, NO baseline-beat drift \u2192 the cog's learned policy is the SOLE driver. Tests whether the actor can learn to SEQUENCE forwards toward a delayed reward; time-to-food per trial is the learning curve. body_model=bidirectional_paddler + reflex_modular.",
    "env_target": "cell",
    "phase_tag": "6.9.corridor",
    "reflex_modular": true,
    "body_model": "bidirectional_paddler",
    "motor_baseline_beat": false,
    "motor_energy": false,
    "corridor": true,
    "corridor_distance": 6.0,
    "nutrients": 1,
    "energy_drain": 0.0,
    "scent_sigma": 6.0,
    "room_size": 24.0,
    "obstacle_density": 0.0,
    "terrain_amplitude": 0.0,
    "vision_green_gain": 0.0,
    "food_respawn": true
  },
  "version": 1,
  "runtime": {
    "thread_pool": "per_instance",
    "num_threads": 0
  },
  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "scent_compass",
      "type": "ScentCompass",
      "params": {
        "input_topic": "reality.proprio.scent",
        "output_topic": "percept.scent_compass",
        "nostril_count": 8,
        "emit_proximity": true,
        "proximity_gain": 0.5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "epm_bearing",
      "_comment": "Coarse 1-D state from the forward scent (cy) + proximity. max 8 nodes, mitosis off \u2014 a handful of corridor states, fully readable.",
      "type": "EPM",
      "params": {
        "modality_group": "nav",
        "modality_name": "bearing",
        "encoder_kind": "rbf",
        "input_topic": "reality.proprio.scent_max",
        "projection_dim": 32,
        "proprio_state_dims": 1,
        "baking_threshold": 30,
        "min_insertion_error": 0.05,
        "max_nodes": 12,
        "mitosis_enabled": false,
        "process_every_n_ticks": 1,
        "subtract_descending_prediction": false,
        "_comment": "1-D distance state: RBF on scent proximity (monotonic far\u2192near). Was 3-D scent_compass \u2192 RBF L2-norm + wide sigma washed out distance into ONE node (corridor finding)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "neuro",
      "type": "NeurochemState",
      "params": {
        "da_baseline": 0.2,
        "ht_baseline": 0.65,
        "da_decay": 0.88,
        "ht_decay": 0.93,
        "intrinsic_da_gain": 0.05,
        "event_coupled_da": true,
        "event_coupled_ht": true,
        "da_baseline_ema_alpha": 0.001,
        "scent_da_rate": 0.5,
        "green_da_rate": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "drive",
      "type": "HomeostaticDrive",
      "params": {
        "channels": [
          "energy",
          "scent_proximity"
        ],
        "channel_kinds": [
          "energy",
          "proprio_passive"
        ],
        "setpoints": [
          0.8,
          1.0
        ],
        "urgency_normalizers": [
          1.0,
          1.0
        ],
        "channel_input_topics": [
          "reality.proprio.energy",
          "reality.proprio.scent_max"
        ],
        "energy_drain_per_tick": 0.0,
        "energy_replenish_per_hit": 0.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "action_plan",
      "_comment": "COXSWAIN, THRUST-ONLY: turn channel zeroed (action_bins=1, accel 0..0); thrust_bins=3 \u2192 {reverse,pause,forward}. pref_obs = scent_compass cy (forward/food-ahead). Plans H=3 over the learned forward model. Publishes cog.steer(=0) + cog.thrust.",
      "params": {
        "consensus_level": -1,
        "proprio_topic": "reality.nav.bearing",
        "output_topic": "cog.steer",
        "joint_action": true,
        "thrust_output_topic": "cog.thrust",
        "action_bins": 1,
        "accel_min": 0.0,
        "accel_max": 0.0,
        "thrust_bins": 3,
        "thrust_accel_min": -4.0,
        "thrust_accel_max": 4.0,
        "plan_horizon": 3,
        "plan_gamma": 0.9,
        "pref_obs_topic": "reality.proprio.scent_max",
        "pref_obs_index": 0,
        "green_obs_topic": "",
        "w_scent": 2.0,
        "w_green": 0.0,
        "efe_select": true,
        "epistemic_gain": 0.1,
        "td_gamma": 0.0,
        "use_rollout": false,
        "use_chunks": false,
        "commit_ticks": 60,
        "_comment": "COXSWAIN thrust-only. pref_obs = scent PROXIMITY (raise it = get closer); heading-locked so facing is a non-issue. Plans H=3 over the learned distance-state forward model."
      },
      "type": "ActionDecoder"
    },
    {
      "id": "motor_bus",
      "_comment": "Single cog channel (steer_thrust): L=thrust+steer, R=thrust\u2212steer; steer\u22480 \u2192 pure common-mode forward/reverse. gain 1, input_scale 4 (\u00b14 accel \u2192 \u00b11), limit 4.",
      "type": "MotorBus",
      "params": {
        "influencer_names": [
          "cog"
        ],
        "kinds": [
          "steer_thrust"
        ],
        "topics_a": [
          "cog.steer"
        ],
        "topics_b": [
          "cog.thrust"
        ],
        "input_scale": [
          4.0
        ],
        "gains": [
          1.0
        ],
        "limit": 4.0,
        "active_window": 2,
        "output_left": "action.left",
        "output_right": "action.right"
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": []
}